# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-specific. The block above is create-next-app's; this one is ours and
# survives re-scaffolding. Keep them separate so the next `create-next-app`
# overwrite is obvious in the diff.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# .env.example is committed on purpose — every variable documented, no values.
# The generated `.env*` line above would otherwise exclude it.
!.env.example

# The original hand-off archive. Its contents are laid out in the repo already;
# committing it would duplicate every tracked document.
where-i-go.zip

# Local Community Solid Server data (pnpm/npm `pod:dev`). Disposable.
.pod-data/
